  "modifications": "Phone atlas exported from the Z-Anatomy blend. Skin is the regional body surface without hair. Muscle, organs (including the brain), and bone are split into head, torso, arms, and legs. Each piece has a coarse far mesh and a finer mesh that loads only while that region is close. Nerves, vessels, and male and female reproductive structures were not exported, so the body reads as unisex.",
